      "text": "Update logs provide valuable information that you can use to troubleshoot Private Access (ZPA) App Connector update issues."
    },
    {
      "text": "To view the update logs:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Settings > Topology > ZPA App Connectors.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          14
        ],
        [
          17,
          25
        ],
        [
          28,
          46
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Logs for an App Connector to view the update logs.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select View update logs from the drop-down menu.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          23
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
